5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is rarely ready when I need it. I need a system that guarantees reliability.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Honestly, the mental load of coordinating is killing me. I just want less friction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the numbers. A fair share requires knowing the true cost of each use.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I worry we are drifting apart. I want to understand what actually sours groups like ours.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I can't guess who drives how much. I need the real figures to see the actual usage.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, numbers are good, but they don't fix a dirty car. I need state checks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, if we track every run, maybe the arguing stops? I want to see the hours.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, tracking hours is a start. But we must also see the fuel receipts to balance costs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, I agree. I want to see what other households did to avoid this exact fight.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I agree. I need the fuel receipts and the diary hours to get the full picture.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the handover state and the mechanic's remarks. Those tell the truth.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'll look at the hours in the diary and the weekly trips. That shows the pattern.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will examine the fuel receipts and the tax and insurance papers. That is the baseline.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will look into what two other car-sharing households said and our own past attempts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look into the fuel receipts and the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
